    "description": {
      "value": "The visages of beasts are carved into the painted wood of a beast staff, with a large head on top. When used as a weapon, the staff is a staff. While wielding the staff while you have it prepared, you're affected by speak with animals. If you have Wild Empathy, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus on checks using it.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\nUsed as a weapon, the staff is a +2 greater striking staff. The circumstance bonus if you have Wild Empathy is +2.\n\n- - **5th:** animal form, insect form, moon frenzy\n- - **6th:** baleful polymorph, moon frenzy"
